window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>What they don’t know may doom the livable worlds</b></p> <p>Captain Elya Nevers and the Furies face a different kind of danger back home as they bid farewell to fallen comrades, wade into the murky realm of Solaran politics, and hunt for knowledge about the Telos relics—while being hunted themselves.</p> <p>Overmind X is still at large. She’s hungry to get her talons on the next artifact of alien power. Will she find it before the Solarans get their own house in order?</p> <p>And what terrifying existential threat to the galaxy does she become if they’re too late?</p> <p><b><i>Hidden Relics</i></b><b> is the second interstellar adventure in the </b><b><i>Relics of the Ancients</i></b><b> series of space opera novels by best-selling author M. G. Herron. For fans of </b><b><i>Star Wars</i></b><b>, </b><b><i>Battlestar Galactica</i></b><b>, and anyone who enjoys seeing starfighter pilots and their bots kick some serious alien menace.</b></p>"; 
